        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLW7012SMTFBR, Offset 12 Inch Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Offset 12 Inch Spanish Door Pull can be mounted on glass, wood, fiberglass, or metal doors. Choose from back-to-back, surface, or thru-bolt mounting. This door handle is available in lots of different finishes, ranging from traditional to in-season so you'll be able to find the perfect fit for your home. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW08-specifcations.gif?v=1704354640\" width=\"422\" height=\"329\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions DLW7012SMTFBR Dimensions Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: With straight mounting brackets <a href=\"/products/spanish-12-inch-door-pull-first-impressions-dlw7012smtsbr\"><b>12 Inch Decorative Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 12 Inch Offset Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Offset from Mounting Centerline: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW08-specifications.pdf?v=1704262222\"><b>First Impressions DLW7012SMTFBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This offset door pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Finishes</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
