                "description": "The Offset 12 Inch Spanish Door Pull can be mounted on glass, wood, or metal doors. Choose from back-to-back, surface, or thru-bolt mounting. This door handle is available in lots of different finishes, ranging from traditional to in-season so you'll be able to find the perfect fit for your home. \r\n",
